submission_format:
Return a JSON object directly as your final answer. Save artifact files under /workspace/; artifact paths may start with /workspace/ or be relative to /workspace/. Use the keys shown below, replacing the example paths with your saved files. Replace the 0.0 placeholders with your calculated results. List all raw LAMMPS logs in execution order, covering initialization, cooling, and the final hold. Retain the echoed initialization commands, including loading the supplied melt, setting up the potential, and selecting the timestep. If initialization is recorded in a separate log, include that file first, as shown below. A single log containing initialization, cooling, and the hold is also accepted.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "raw_logs": [
      "/workspace/output/in.log",
      "/workspace/output/log.cool",
      "/workspace/output/log.hold"
    ]
  },
  "results": {
    "cooling_tg_K": 0.0
  }
}
```
